# A listing is a claim about a repository this project does not own, and the
# compiled output is read by every page that renders the registry. So a change
# under modules/ or to the schema needs a maintainer's confirmation, not a
# green check.
#
# This file only requests the review. Requiring it is a branch protection
# setting on main ("Require review from Code Owners"), and without that setting
# the request is advisory.

*                   @druxt/maintainers

/modules/           @druxt/maintainers
/icons/             @druxt/maintainers
/schema/            @druxt/maintainers
